abstract: "Behavioral Update Fidelity measures whether an AI changes its behavior exactly when, and only as far as, changes in governing information warrant. This repository contains the formal specification (docs/BUF-SPEC.md), an independent reference implementation with exhaustive model-checking of its theorems, language-neutral conformance vectors with a mutation library, and the contradish toolkit. Behavioral Update Fidelity was introduced by Michele Joseph in 2026."
